.-----------------------=[ SetLRP MENU HELP PAGE]=----------------------------.
|                                                                             |
|  1 - Set LastReadPointer for the base from which you had started mail       |
|  2 - Set LastReadPointers for all message bases. The value you insert       |
|      will be set as a LRP for all selected (from SMB) message bases         |
|  3 - Set LastReadPointers message base by message base also selected        |
|      from SMB... You'll see the name and the current LRP for that base.     |
|      If you wish to abort this operation enter a empty string.              |
|  4 - Set LastReadPointers for all selected message bases ... you'll         |
|      be asked to enter the number of how many days back you wish to set     |
|      LRPs.                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|  NOTE                                                                       |
|       If you wish to abort any of above mentioned operations just put       |
|       empty string in any of thoose questionnaieres.                        |
|                                                                             |
`-----------------------------------------------------------------------------'
